class="navbar__search searchBarContainer_NW3z" dir="ltr"><input placeholder="Search" aria-label="Search" class="navbar__search-input searchInput_YFbd" value=""><div class="loadingRing_RJI3 searchBarLoadingRing_YnHq"><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="presentation" class="navbar-sidebar__backdrop"></div></nav><div id="__docusaurus_skipToContent_fallback" class="theme-layout-main main-wrapper mainWrapper_z2l0"><header class="heroBanner_qdFl"><div class="container heroInner_V4lS"><p class="heroKicker_bJTY">Shoplazza developer docs</p><h1 class="heroTitle_qg2I"><span><span class="srOnly_ZtxB">Build apps / themes / APIs with Shoplazza.</span><span aria-hidden="true">Build <span class="slot_uUgM"><span class="visible_52SU">apps<span class="caret_v7aZ"></span> with Shoplazza.</span><span class="ghost__mIC">apps<span class="caretSpacer_t_r1"></span> with Shoplazza.</span><span class="ghost__mIC">themes<span class="caretSpacer_t_r1"></span> with Shoplazza.</span><span class="ghost__mIC">APIs<span class="caretSpacer_t_r1"></span> with Shoplazza.</span></span></span></span></h1><p class="subtitle_RlPM">Learn how to build apps, design themes, and integrate with our versioned REST API. Whether you&#x27;re just starting out or shipping to the Shoplazza App Store, our docs cover the full lifecycle.</p></div></header><main><section class="band_nBM7"><div class="container"><p class="bandKicker_L9qi">Get started</p><h2 class="bandHeading_AA_w">What do you want to build?</h2><p class="bandDescription_Y1b3">Pick your goal and jump straight into the right guide.</p><div class="cardRow_vnkF"><a class="featureCard_QAQr" href="/docs/app/getting-started/create-public-app/develop-app"><span class="featureIndex_Fo1m">01</span><span class="featureTitle_L1YZ">Public app</span><p class="featureDescription_sP1D">Build an app other merchants can install — OAuth, REST API, and webhooks.</p><span class="featureTail_fDml">OAuth · API · webhooks</span><span class="featureArrow__CMR" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="featureCard_QAQr" href="/docs/app/getting-started/create-payment-app/"><span class="featureIndex_Fo1m">02</span><span class="featureTitle_L1YZ">Payment app</span><p class="featureDescription_sP1D">Integrate a payment provider with Shoplazza checkout.</p><span class="featureTail_fDml">sale · refund · 3DS</span><span class="featureArrow__CMR" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="featureCard_QAQr" href="/docs/theme/getting-started/"><span class="featureIndex_Fo1m">03</span><span class="featureTitle_L1YZ">Theme</span><p class="featureDescription_sP1D">Design storefront themes with Liquid, JSON sections, and the CLI.</p><span class="featureTail_fDml">liquid · sections</span><span class="featureArrow__CMR" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="featureCard_QAQr" href="/docs/app/extensions/"><span class="featureIndex_Fo1m">04</span><span class="featureTitle_L1YZ">Extension</span><p class="featureDescription_sP1D">Extend checkout and the storefront with checkout and theme extensions.</p><span class="featureTail_fDml">checkout · theme blocks</span><span class="featureArrow__CMR" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="band_nBM7"><div class="container"><p class="bandKicker_L9qi">Go deeper</p><h2 class="bandHeading_AA_w">Tools &amp; reference</h2><div class="deeperGrid_lsqk"><div><p class="linkGroupLabel_c0ML">Developer tools</p><ul class="linkList_pfcn"><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/app/developer-tools/shoplazza-cli/"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">Shoplazza CLI</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">Build, preview, and deploy apps and themes from the command line.</span></a></li><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/app/developer-tools/app-bridge/"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">App Bridge</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">Embed your app in the Shoplazza admin with session tokens and actions.</span></a></li><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/app/developer-tools/api-libraries"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">API libraries</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">Official SDK and client libraries for multiple languages.</span></a></li></ul></div><div><p class="linkGroupLabel_c0ML">References</p><ul class="linkList_pfcn"><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/api/openapi"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">REST API</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">The Admin API for reading and writing products, orders, customers, and more.</span></a></li><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/app/building-blocks/authentication/"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">Authentication</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">OAuth flow, access scopes, and signature verification.</span></a></li><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/app/building-blocks/webhooks/overview"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">Webhooks</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">Subscribe to store events and receive real-time notifications.</span></a></li><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/app/building-blocks/billing/overview"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">Billing</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">Charge merchants with one-time, recurring, or usage-based pricing.</span></a></li><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/theme/references/liquid/"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">Liquid</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">Objects, tags, and filters for rendering dynamic storefront content.</span></a></li><li><a class="linkRow_GLpo" href="/docs/theme/references/ajax-api/"><span class="linkRowTitle_EOHP">Ajax API</span><span class="linkRowDescription_n5Ak">Storefront endpoints for cart, product, collection, and search.</span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></section></main></div><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer__container"><div class="footer-inner"><div class="footer-col"><h2 class="footer-col__title">Developers</h2><ul class="footer-col__list"><li><a class="footer-col__link" href="/api/openapi">APIs</a>